@startuml
title Offline licence activation - MVP2 automated (LIC-011); MVP1 manual flow in figure 19
actor Doctor
participant "Desktop app\n(no internet)" as APP
participant "Doctor's phone" as PH
participant "Portal" as POR
participant "Licence API" as API
participant "KMS" as KMS
Doctor -> APP : Activate -> "No internet"
APP -> APP : fingerprint (3 components)\nbuild Activation Request code
APP --> Doctor : request code + QR
Doctor -> PH : scan QR
PH -> POR : open /activate?req=CODE
POR -> Doctor : OTP login or buy (UPI)
POR -> API : POST /v1/activate/offline(req)
API -> API : check key, seats, rate limit
API -> KMS : sign compact licence
KMS --> API : Ed25519 signature
API --> POR : response code
POR --> PH : response QR + text
Doctor -> APP : scan with webcam or type code
APP -> APP : CRC check per group\nverify signature (embedded pubkey)\nmatch fingerprint (2 of 3)
APP --> Doctor : Activated until <date>
@enduml
